"الخطوة 1: المفعول <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">the speakers</span> يصير فاعلاً.": "Step 1: the object <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">the speakers</span> becomes the subject.",
"الخطوة 2: جمع فنستعمل <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">are</span>، ونُبقي التصريف الثالث <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">broken</span>.": "Step 2: it is plural, so we use <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">are</span>, and we keep the third form <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">broken</span>.",
"الخطوة 1: الاسم من <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">dent</span> هو <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a dent</span>.": "Step 1: the noun from <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">dent</span> is <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">a dent</span>.",
"الخطوة 2: القالب <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">There's a … in …</span>.": "Step 2: the pattern is <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">There's a … in …</span>.",
